# code-is-reduction root (#189, case a — a STILL-DEFERRED reduction)

library "Pol".

// A `code is` + `definition is` reduction concept whose reduction is NOT yet emittable
// (`most recent this` — Slice A2/B1 activated `exists this` and `count this`; the value-read/recency
// forms wait for Slice B2). `lowerLocalCodes` catches this BEFORE the generic mixed check and raises
// `emit-reduction-not-active` (case a). On the FHIR lane, the lane's OWN lowerLocalCodes pass surfaces
// it, and the folded CQL copy is de-duped — so the FHIR result carries EXACTLY ONE, with success sunk.
// (`exists this` / `count this` now LOWER instead; their CQL-lane coverage lives in reductions-shape /
// lowerLocalCodes unit tests, and their FHIR case-feature ripple is deferred to Slice C.)

concept "Adult Patient":
- type is Observation.
- value type is Quantity.
- code is `adult-18-or-older`.
- definition is most recent this.
